      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 10,
          "section": "4. Results and discussion",
          "quote": "Characteristics of DDRX are also observed in the structure after hot compression. Some DRX grains often appear at the triple junctions of the uncrystallized grains, the content of LAGBs inside the uncrystallized grains is relatively low, and the grain boundaries tend to be jagged and expanded [56].",
